    {
      "id": "sentence-new-v46-p23-u1-v1",
      "text": "梁末帝即位后，王晏球升任龙骧四军指挥使。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "c18d94235ce6760eb0487caa928688f467ec7c5e32e65ef59216ac6f8fc6427e",
      "originalEnd": 14,
      "paragraphId": "new-v46-p23",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 0,
      "originalSha256": "f5d0d129178979cc06f9c9fe606b97b9e442f0f977b8f0c71eeb9163f074e8b9",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "7779",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "73f009b02ca2905927c42431156125dade4bc10f2d0f02f95c286a42a14f4ea9",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-new-v46-p23-u2-v1",
      "text": "后梁派捉生军将领李霸率一千人戍守杨刘；李霸夜间叛乱，从水门入城，纵火喧嚣，用长竿绑上浸透油的布，向上焚烧建国门。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2a98ec6ffe4423fa3b92d2011e806d2a407e698e6b0c33cfcfa14a19035951c2",
      "originalEnd": 58,
      "paragraphId": "new-v46-p23",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 14,
      "originalSha256": "f5d0d129178979cc06f9c9fe606b97b9e442f0f977b8f0c71eeb9163f074e8b9",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "7779",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "73f009b02ca2905927c42431156125dade4bc10f2d0f02f95c286a42a14f4ea9",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-new-v46-p23-u3-v1",
      "text": "王晏球听到变乱，没有等待命令，便率五百龙骧骑兵迎击，叛军的势头稍稍退却。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "d29caeb815fc37f1ba1024f6e294188c7244446f1e48f1b92c6e5af25b939d50",
      "originalEnd": 81,
      "paragraphId": "new-v46-p23",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 58,
      "originalSha256": "f5d0d129178979cc06f9c9fe606b97b9e442f0f977b8f0c71eeb9163f074e8b9",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "7779",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "73f009b02ca2905927c42431156125dade4bc10f2d0f02f95c286a42a14f4ea9",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-new-v46-p23-u4-v1",
      "text": "梁末帝登上城楼看见他们，叫道：“这不是我的龙骧军吗！”王晏球奏报说：“叛乱的只是李霸的一都兵马；请陛下严守宫城，交给臣去击破叛军。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "c83065d63eafeda4348a0974d138730a035ca3761568d970a39ee2a15172cac2",
      "originalEnd": 130,
      "paragraphId": "new-v46-p23",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 81,
      "originalSha256": "f5d0d129178979cc06f9c9fe606b97b9e442f0f977b8f0c71eeb9163f074e8b9",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "7779",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "73f009b02ca2905927c42431156125dade4bc10f2d0f02f95c286a42a14f4ea9",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-new-v46-p23-u5-v1",
      "text": "天快亮时，王晏球杀尽叛军，因功获授澶州的官职〈古本将“澶”字写作“单”。〉",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "ffd41177e8f0bbaaf9165f0c51b7e16f7fc27c23a6372d221829a0f10530b786",
      "originalEnd": 147,
      "paragraphId": "new-v46-p23",
      "reviewNotes": [
        "原文夹注内的句号将“澶〈古本作单。〉州刺史”拆开；此处依上下文说明授官及异文，具体官职续见下一句。"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 130,
      "originalSha256": "f5d0d129178979cc06f9c9fe606b97b9e442f0f977b8f0c71eeb9163f074e8b9",
      "originalRevision": 1,
